On-device AI is like having a smart computer in your pocket! Instead of sending all your data to a server (like a big computer on the internet), it processes information right where you are. For example, when you take a photo with your phone, the AI analyzes it instantly on your device, not sending the image to a server. This means faster responses, better privacy, and no need for internet. It's like having a tiny brain that can think and make decisions right there, without needing a server to help.

